| wonder if we'll want to visit this
world once we get home?

00:20:30.095 --> 00:20:32.359
Who knows? It's possible.

00:20:39.438 --> 00:20:41.338
Right on schedule.

00:20:43.041 --> 00:20:47.522
It's me. Yes, I see.
I'm ready when you are.

00:20:47.546 --> 00:20:50.607
Then transport those two to
the city immediately.

00:20:51.883 --> 00:20:53.361
Those Who Hunt Elves,

00:20:53.385 --> 00:20:56.013
your fun-loving, carefree days
have come to an end.

00:20:59.258 --> 00:21:00.969
What is it now, Ms. Celcia?

00:21:00.993 --> 00:21:03.338
I'm picking up a strong elf reading!

00:21:03.362 --> 00:21:05.057
Really? Where?

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.692
A seven day drive to the northeast.

00:21:08.033 --> 00:21:11.713
Let's go! If she says a week, we
can make it in three days!

00:21:11.737 --> 00:21:13.581
Three days, I tell you!

00:21:13.605 --> 00:21:15.516
Let's hunt some elves!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.008
Mike!

00:21:27.486 --> 00:21:29.420
The fun is just about to start.

00:21:32.591 --> 00:21:34.559
To be continued.

00:21:53.078 --> 00:22:00.161
Yaru ki ga nai hi wa yasunda mo ii yo

00:22:00.185 --> 00:22:06.818
Jinsei wa nagakutte kimagure da kara

00:22:07.192 --> 00:22:14.275
Watashi wa anata o hyakubai ni dekiru

00:22:14.299 --> 00:22:17.512
Sore ja mou nechaimashou

00:22:17.536 --> 00:22:20.995
Sotto daitete ne

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:26.401
Kyouryuu ni atta te

00:22:28.513 --> 00:22:35.229
Wa haha to warau, sonna hito

00:22:35.253 --> 00:22:41.936
Hana mo arashi mo hora fumikoenagara

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:49.544
Jidai ga kawatte iku kenai ga kikoeru

00:22:49.568 --> 00:22:56.250
Sui mo amai mo baby, kamiwakenagara

00:22:56.274 --> 00:23:04.274
Kujikenaide ne tensai wa
saigo ni kuru no

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:13.201
| know I'm only a guest character,

00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:15.193
but I get to read a preview
announcement nonetheless.

00:23:15.994 --> 00:23:18.292
| guess one of the staff
writers likes me.

00:23:19.030 --> 00:23:20.498
He must be the only one who does.

00:23:21.466 --> 00:23:25.767
I'm not a funny man, so the next
episode will be very serious.

00:23:26.705 --> 00:23:29.174
Next Those Who Hunt Elves:

00:23:29.608 --> 00:23:32.373
"No Tomorrows for the Captured!"

00:23:33.311 --> 00:23:36.281
Watch it, or I'll come after you.
